发词：Perfect Eyes，完美眼睛，Detailed skin，完美皮肤，Skin blemish，皮肤瑕疵\n\nFLUX- Ultimator-lora-增加细节\n\nFLUX- vividizer-lora-增加细节及创意扭曲\n\nFLUX Image Upgrader V0.1图像升级+增加细节+对比度修复\n触发词：detailmaximizer，细节最大化，max details，最大细节\n\nFLUX-No Shine 消除光泽\n\nFLUX-Subsurface Scattering Skin次表面散射皮肤\n\nFLUX-Skin Details for Portraits肖像的皮肤细节\n触发词：detailed skin，细致皮肤，detailed skin pores，细致的皮肤毛孔\n\nFLUX-Delicious Food-lora-美食\n触发词：1qqq,\n\nFLUX-dev-lora-Logo-Design-标志设计\n触发词：wablogo, logo, Minimalist\n\nFlux Koda Diffusion-v1.0-lora-90年代风格\n触发词：flmft style\n\nFlux Dark fantasy -v1.0-lora-黑暗奇幻流金光效\n\nFLUX- Magic Array-lora-魔法阵元素\n触发词：bailing_magic_circle，魔法圈\n\nFLUX- Thunder element-lora-闪电元素\n辅助词：bailing_lightning，闪电\n\nFLUX-sparklycism-lora-火花发光\n辅助词：glow，发光，sparks，火花，particles，粒子\n\nFLUX- Fire Element-lora-火元素\n辅助词：bailing_fire，救火，A girl made entirely of flames stands，完全由火构成的少女站着\n\nFLUX- abel water-lora-万物化水态\n辅助词：water dragon,水龙，Crystal, 水晶，blur,模糊， splash,水花， water around body,水围绕周身\n\nFLUX- abel blood-lora-万物化水态\n****辅助词：red liquid，红色液体，water dragon,水龙，Crystal, 水晶，blur,模糊， splash,水花， water around body,水围绕周身 \n\nFLUX- Water World-lora-水世界\n辅助词：ck-wtr，transparent，透明，made out of ck-wtr，由ck-wtr制作\n\nFLUX-Filmfotos-lora-电影肖像\n触发词：filmfotos，film grain，reversal film photography，\n\nAWPortrait-FL-lora 肖像模特\n\nFLUX- Aesthetic Amateur Photo V4-lora-素人写真\n触发词：43stet1c，\n\nFLUX-Vintage Abstract Film-lora-唯美褪色胶片\n\nFLUX-mooniverse-lora-柔美风格\n触发词：surreal style\n\nflux1_asian_female_v0.1亚洲女性 Lora\n触发词：a young woman\n\nFLUX Beauty Face-V1 中国汉服女孩\n触发词：beauty_face，美丽的脸，chinese style，中国风格\n\nFLUX汉服肚兜 | FLUX Hanfu belly wrap\n\nFLUX-miniature-people-迷你人\n触发词：miniature man,微型男人,miniature woman,微型女人,miniature people,微型人物\n\nFlux 3D Render Style Flux 3D 渲染风格\n触发词：3d render,3D渲染\n\nFLUX- AWPoly-lora-3D充气人物\n触发词： AWPoly3D，3D rendering，3D渲染，3Dcomi，\n\nflux-minecraft-movie 我的世界\n触发词： MNCRFTMOV，\n\nFLUX1-超写实逼真黑悟空 Lora\n触发词：aiyouxiketang\n\n黑神话悟空-写实逼真 Lora\n触发词：heiwukong"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "ty